The Goldfish prompts in reference/goldfish.md adapt the reviewer prompts of
the Elephant-Goldfish Model: agents/comprehension.md, agents/design_critic.md
and agents/implementation_readiness.md in
https://github.com/google/elephant-goldfish-model

