The cairn version is changed: it shortens the prompts, rewrites them in
Simplified Technical English and adds fixed output formats.

reference/writing.md takes ideas, not text, from SimpleEnglish
(https://github.com/AminBlg/SimpleEnglish, MIT): two registers, terms
explained at first use, and few rules with examples.

reference/design.md adapts the section approval gate and the check of a
draft against its brainstorm from skills/egm-draft/SKILL.md of the
Elephant-Goldfish Model (Apache-2.0, as above).
